{"v":4,"catch":"坐在駕駛艙裡，然後飛向太空！","desc":"“THUNDER CEPTOR II”是 NAMCO（現為“Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc”）於 1986 年發行的射擊遊戲。\n這個標題是之前“THUNDER CEPTOR”的更新，玩家在連接恆星系統的能量走廊中航行，返回聯邦基地。 現在以新的舞台佈局和敵人為特色！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-03-16","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/43a9e45e0d8737cc22594bbbca3cda902c224be091678f3cc836a9348fecac31.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1d188b987b5978359aad3b41bb33c40984f6f3abd0c7dd92712b4ea8904c532c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b1b89b08c5854a1c48ef06d903c6f76c3a81597cbf3e8eddb7dceb05c2664168.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/de471179948a8a477bf5511ed557187c3ad7fe64bd10a06507a8cefd2cae5306.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c12aa67288477c8cf55b845e9a45a613d58dc071d00b01602351d9ec2dd7f2d4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ae0996ae527cd01777761389c063359fe6cfb90d9cd3ef6c0675b5fdc3b0fc20.jpg"],"titleId":"010044201854c000","dlc":[]}